### 4.6 The interactive 3D mark (raw three, in `IntroScene.tsx`)
Rendering: full-viewport transparent canvas behind the UI; camera fov ≈ 34, `z ≈ 8`; the mark occupies roughly 42–48% of viewport width on desktop and ≈ 78% of width on portrait phones; recompute on resize/orientation change (ResizeObserver). Materials, environment (`RoomEnvironment` PMREM) and geometry come from `dfMark3D.ts`: black-chrome / black-glass body with real bevels, glossy magenta dot.
