Auto-revolve: continuous slow yaw about 0.27 rad/s (≈ 23s per full turn), eased with a DWELL at the front-facing pose: `speed = base * (0.35 + 0.65 * smoothstep(0, 1, |sin(yaw/2)|))`, so it lingers when the DF. faces the viewer and passes quickly over the (mirrored) back. Add a gentle pitch sway (±0.06 rad) and a tiny float (±4 units).

